{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You run your own pizza shop in a small neighborhood.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage every detail, from choosing the oven to dough varieties and baking settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your restaurant with neon signs, lighting, d\u00e9cor, and furniture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your menu exactly the way you want, name your pizzas, and select the ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange tables, add decorative elements, and create a complete dining experience with music options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your signature pizzas and surprise customers with unique flavors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track customer feedback and satisfaction scores to refine your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost sales with promotions, daily specials, and takeout deals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and manage staff while monitoring inventory to control costs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maximize profits with daily, weekly, and monthly financial reports.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in pizza festivals, win awards, and elevate your restaurant\u2019s reputation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small neighborhood pizzeria into a city-wide pizza empire.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720070?t=1763229355","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720070?t=1763229355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/00416679a5b3576c348095bde3068a0716a7e114/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763229355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720070/00416679a5b3576c348095bde30